5
00:00:23,854 --> 00:00:28,467
By the end of this module you should be able to: Explain natural selection using

6
00:00:28,467 --> 00:00:33,138
variation, heritability, and reproductive success; Define fitness in evolutionary

7
00:00:33,138 --> 00:00:37,520
terms; Distinguish individual change from population evolution; Use multiple

8
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:42,133
